OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1786020504
OL,3,CMan arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,4,Cand shooting victim named
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof murder following a fatal shooting
OL,8,Fnear Cricklade.
OL,10,FThe suspect, aged 35, was arrested on
OL,11,FTuesday 4 August in relation to the
OL,12,Fshooting at a traveller site in
OL,13,FCalcutt at around 8.15am on Sunday 2
OL,14,FAugust.
OL,16,FThe victim, who can now be formally
OL,17,Fnamed as Jimmy Ward, 36, was declared
OL,18,Fdead at the scene.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
