PN,40702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1786020504
OL,3,CMan arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,4,Cand shooting victim named
OL,6,FFirst, a man in his 70s and a woman in
OL,7,Fher 40s were arrested on suspicion of
OL,8,Fpossession of a firearm and assisting
OL,9,Fan offender.
OL,11,FTwo other men, aged 53 and 29, were
OL,12,Fthen arrested on Tuesday 4 August on
OL,13,Fsuspicion of assisting an offender
OL,14,Ffollowing a vehicle stop on the A419.
OL,16,FThe latest arrest takes the total
OL,17,Fnumber of people arrested to five.
OL,19,FAll five people are in custody for
OL,20,Fquestioning.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5
