PN,40703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1786020504
OL,3,CMan arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,4,Cand shooting victim named
OL,6,FA cordon, which was put in place at
OL,7,Fthe site following the shooting,
OL,8,Fremains in place with an increased
OL,9,Fpolicing presence. Wiltshire Police
OL,10,Fsays it will remain in place in the
OL,11,Fcoming days while further enquiries
OL,12,Fcontinue at the site.
OL,14,FThe investigation is being led by the
OL,15,FMajor Crime Investigation Team (MCIT).
OL,17,FSenior Investigating Officer Detective
OL,18,FChief Inspector Phil Walker, from
OL,19,FMCIT, said: "This is a significant
OL,20,Fdevelopment in our investigation.
OL,26,@{D@MOU
