OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1786020504
OL,3,CMan arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,4,Cand shooting victim named
OL,6,F"I can confirm that a man has been
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of Jimmy's
OL,8,Fmurder and is now in police custody,
OL,9,Falong with four other people on
OL,10,Fsuspicion of assisting an offender.
OL,12,F"Jimmy's next of kin have been
OL,13,Finformed of this development and my
OL,14,Fthoughts continue to be with them.
OL,15,FThey are being supported by specially
OL,16,Ftrained officers.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOU
