PN,40705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1786020504
OL,3,CMan arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,4,Cand shooting victim named
OL,6,F"A scene and heavy policing presence
OL,7,Fremain in place at the traveller site
OL,8,Fin Calcutt while further enquiries are
OL,9,Fcarried out. I continue to ask that
OL,10,Fthis cordon is respected.
OL,12,F"I'd like to thank the local community
OL,13,Ffor their support and patience since
OL,14,FSunday. We understand this incident
OL,15,Fhas caused significant concern, so
OL,16,Fplease consider speaking with officers
OL,17,Fabout any information or concerns you
OL,18,Fmay have."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUzD@JO]
